{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019b4GaBrphrcjd8grezMnQT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# KERTAS TUGASAN / ASSIGNMENT SHEET\n2\t\n3\t**Kod / Code:** S960-002-3:2020-C01/KT(1/5)\n4\t**Competency Unit:** C01 — Body Consultation / Konsultasi Badan\n5\t**Work Activity 1:** Prepare Body Consultation Work Area\n6\t**Reference:** KP(1/5) — Hygiene, Safety and Work Area Preparation\n7\t**Paper Colour / Warna Kertas:** PINK / MERAH JAMBU\n8\t\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t## Instructions (Arahan)\n12\t\n13\tAnswer ALL questions. Refer to Information Sheet KP(1/5) for reference.\n14\tJawab SEMUA soalan. Rujuk Kertas Penerangan KP(1/5) untuk rujukan.\n15\t\n16\t---\n17\t\n18\t## Questions (Soalan)\n19\t\n20\t### Question 1 — Multiple Choice (Soalan Aneka Pilihan)\n21\t\n22\tWhich of the following is the CORRECT temperature range for a comfortable body consultation room?\n23\t\n24\tA. 18-20 C\n25\tB. 24-26 C\n26\tC. 28-30 C\n27\tD. 32-34 C\n28\t\n29\t### Question 2 — True or False (Betul atau Salah)\n30\t\n31\tState whether the following statements are TRUE or FALSE. Provide a brief justification for each answer.\n32\t\n33\ta) The weighing scale should be calibrated once a week before use.\n34\t\n35\tb) Fresh towels and linen must be provided for each client.\n36\t\n37\tc) The fire extinguisher must be located inside the treatment room.\n38\t\n39\td) Electrical equipment in the salon must be PAT compliant.\n40\t\n41\t### Question 3 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n42\t\n43\tList FIVE (5) hygiene practices that must be observed in the body consultation service area.\n44\t\n45\t### Question 4 — Matching (Padanan)\n46\t\n47\tMatch the tool/equipment with its purpose:\n48\t\n49\t| Tool/Equipment | | Purpose |\n50\t|---------------|---|---------|\n51\t| 1. Measuring tape | | A. Skin examination |\n52\t| 2. Stadiometer | | B. Body measurements |\n53\t| 3. Body fat calliper | | C. Weight measurement |\n54\t| 4. Magnifying lamp | | D. Height measurement |\n55\t| 5. Weighing scale | | E. Skinfold measurement |\n56\t\n57\t### Question 5 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n58\t\n59\tDescribe the logical flow of a body consultation work station layout, from client entry to documentation. Include at least FOUR (4) zones.\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"39c56169-26c0-472a-94b4-c164c63a4f53","uuid":"ef7c8fdf-5297-4290-ac6e-79fbbbdcca37","timestamp":"2026-04-17T04:59:24.157Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\aesthetic-services\\C01\\KT-01.md","content":"# KERTAS TUGASAN / ASSIGNMENT SHEET\n\n**Kod / Code:** S960-002-3:2020-C01/KT(1/5)\n**Competency Unit:** C01 — Body Consultation / Konsultasi Badan\n**Work Activity 1:** Prepare Body Consultation Work Area\n**Reference:** KP(1/5) — Hygiene, Safety and Work Area Preparation\n**Paper Colour / Warna Kertas:** PINK / MERAH JAMBU\n\n---\n\n## Instructions (Arahan)\n\nAnswer ALL questions. Refer to Information Sheet KP(1/5) for reference.\nJawab SEMUA soalan. Rujuk Kertas Penerangan KP(1/5) untuk rujukan.\n\n---\n\n## Questions (Soalan)\n\n### Question 1 — Multiple Choice (Soalan Aneka Pilihan)\n\nWhich of the following is the CORRECT temperature range for a comfortable body consultation room?\n\nA. 18-20 C\nB. 24-26 C\nC. 28-30 C\nD. 32-34 C\n\n### Question 2 — True or False (Betul atau Salah)\n\nState whether the following statements are TRUE or FALSE. Provide a brief justification for each answer.\n\na) The weighing scale should be calibrated once a week before use.\n\nb) Fresh towels and linen must be provided for each client.\n\nc) The fire extinguisher must be located inside the treatment room.\n\nd) Electrical equipment in the salon must be PAT compliant.\n\n### Question 3 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n\nList FIVE (5) hygiene practices that must be observed in the body consultation service area.\n\n### Question 4 — Matching (Padanan)\n\nMatch the tool/equipment with its purpose:\n\n| Tool/Equipment | | Purpose |\n|---------------|---|---------|\n| 1. Measuring tape | | A. Skin examination |\n| 2. Stadiometer | | B. Body measurements |\n| 3. Body fat calliper | | C. Weight measurement |\n| 4. Magnifying lamp | | D. Height measurement |\n| 5. Weighing scale | | E. Skinfold measurement |\n\n### Question 5 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n\nDescribe the logical flow of a body consultation work station layout, from client entry to documentation. Include at least FOUR (4) zones.\n","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":107}}}
